 "name": "ST41EV_EVENT00.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "There is a rite: the Fleet Review.",
  "A military parade of warships,",
  "it serves to lift one's own morale,",
  "show the nation its troops' might,",
  "and make a show of force",
  "toward the enemy.",
  "Though held now and then",
  "since the centuries of old,",
  "after losing countless ships in",
  "the One Year War, the Federation",
  "lacked the strength to stage one.",
  "But the Earth Federation Forces",
  "had regained that strength",
  "in a mere three years.",
  "Though not yet equal",
  "to its former strength,",
  "it would show the Federation's",
  "might at home and abroad; of that",
  "there was no doubt.",
  "And at the same time, it meant",
  "that the Earth Federation Forces",
  "had regained both the power",
  "and the will to intimidate",
  "the space emigrants",
  "by force of arms.",
  "What's more, they would hold it",
  "in space, and moreover",
  "at a place that was once",
  "a Zeon fortress.",
  "One can only call it an act",
  "whose intent was all too plain.",
  "Consider, to begin with,",
  "the Konpei Island naval base.",
  "That is, the space fortress",
  "formerly named Solomon",
  "had been built as the \"outer gate\"",
  "set against A Baoa Qu,",
  "the \"front door\" to",
  "the Principality of Zeon.",
  "Accordingly, whenever Zeon",
  "made war in space,",
  "almost without exception,",
  "its ships set out",
  "from this very Solomon.",
  "A Fleet Review at Konpei Island.",
  "However fine the speeches,",
  "it was plain that behind them",
  "flickered a will to threaten,",
  "backed by force; and,",
  "conversely, even the tact",
  "to disguise it had been lost",
  "to the Federation Forces.",
  "The Federation's corruption had",
  "unquestionably advanced further",
  "than in the One Year War.",
  "Small wonder the space-born raged.",
  "Axis Ship",
  "Axis Officer",
  "\"The Federation taking sovereign",
  " control of the Earth Sphere...\"",
  "\"Only Delaz's uprising can stop",
  " that from becoming settled fact.\"",
  "\"Three years now since",
  " we parted ways with him...",
  " Our aims, it seems, are the same.\"",
  "\"Support! Nothing more!\"",
  "\"We do not yet have",
  " the strength to strike out...\"",
  "Axis.",
  "Beyond the sea of stars.",
  "Withdrawn to the asteroid belt:",
  "the remnants of the Zeon forces.",
  "They too felt the same anger",
  "at the Federation's tyranny.",
  "But above all else",
  "they had to survive.",
  "In a dark world even harsher",
  "than the Earth Sphere.",
  "They still did not have",
  "the forces to fight",
  "the Federation alongside",
  "the Delaz Fleet.",
  "\"Where might our advance fleet",
  " be now...?\"",
  "Axis Soldier",
  "\"Sir! Holding the planned course,",
  " it is heading for the rendezvous",
  " with the Delaz Fleet!\"",
  "Haman",
  "\"Well done...\"",
  "(So cold...",
  " How many more years here...)",
  "And so,",
  "even before the humiliation",
  "of the Federation's Fleet Review,",
  "the most Axis could manage",
  "was to send a fleet",
  "in support of the Delaz Fleet.",
  "\"Commander, a message",
  " from His Excellency Delaz.\"",
  "\"Grateful for support of cause",
  " and of Operation Stardust.\"",
  "Axis Captain",
  "\"Heh. A bit of time lag, true,",
  " but he could have called directly.",
  " How very like him.\"",
  "\"Hey... look at that.\"",
  "\"Could it be...\"",
  "\"What is it?",
  " What's going on...? ...!",
  " You saw it?!\"",
  "\"Commander! A postscript!\"",
  "\"Comrades,",
  " welcome to the Earth Sphere.\"",
  "\"Heh, as always, he knows",
  " how to bring a man to tears.\"",
  "Now, just as Delaz said,",
  "the hearts of the people of space",
  "were truly coming together.",
  "To overthrow Federation tyranny,",
  "with the rancor of the oppressed,",
  "to strike down the tyrants' pride!",
  "Yet it was also an omen that",
  "tens of thousands of lives",
  "were about to vanish into space.",
  "And to stop it,",
  "there were warriors who fought.",
  "Those who knew that however much",
  "sorrow piled up,",
  "meeting sin with sin",
  "would only bring",
  "still greater sorrow.",
  "Those who knew revenge breeds",
  "an endless chain of revenge.",
  "Even if no ideals remained,",
  "he raised one again himself;",
  "rather than chase ideals, he held",
  "that drying the tears of children",
  "crying in the real world came first:",
  "such a man was South Burning,",
  "and these were his disciples:",
  "the Albion team.",
  "Kou",
  "\"...Thanks, Keith.",
  " That's the third one down.\"",
  "Keith",
  "\"What's with these guys?",
  " They're not even regulars,",
  " and they just keep coming!\"",
  "\"They're trying to join",
  " the Delaz Fleet...\"",
  "\"No, it's Gato",
  " they're trying",
  " to join up with...\"",
  "\"Somewhere in",
  " this sea of Solomon...\"",
  "At this time, Kou Uraki",
  "is said to have sensed Gato",
  "not by logic but in his bones.",
  "Whether one takes that for",
  "a Newtype's sense, or likens it",
  "to an old-world warrior's instinct,",
  "is up to each person.",
  "What is certain is that he knew",
  "the hour of reckoning",
  "was drawing near.",
  "The Immortal 4th Platoon\n      Takes the Stage",
  "Otto Karius\n      Takes the Stage",
  "Enter the Immortal 4th Platoon",
  "Its captain: the veteran pilot",
  "South Burning.",
  "The Immortal 4th Platoon",
  "fought at Solomon and A Baoa Qu,",
  "two of the One Year War's",
  "greatest, bloodiest battles,",
  "and came back from both",
  "without losing a single man:",
  "a rare unit indeed.",
  "That episode alone",
  "is enough to show",
  "what this platoon could do.",
  "Its members were Burning,",
  "Alpha A. Bate,",
  "Bernard Monsha,",
  "and Chap Adel,",
  "four men in all.",
  "After the One Year War, Burning",
  "left the front line, and they had",
  "gone their separate ways,",
  "but in the Delaz Conflict,",
  "at the wish of Eiphar Synapse,",
  "they would gather once more",
  "aboard the Albion.",
  "Albion Bridge",
  "Operator",
  "\"Lieutenant Bate,",
  " one unknown unit at 0-1-1!",
  " Course clear!\"",
  "Bate",
  "\"I see it!",
  " Can't a guy even",
  " grab a bite to eat?!\"",
  "Synapse",
  "\"How many does",
  " that one make?\"",
  "\"That's the 11th contact.\"",
  "\"One hour",
  " until the Fleet Review...\"",
  "\"Most of our main fleet",
  " is at Konpei Island...\"",
  "\"Was it truly wise",
  " to leave Earth",
  " so badly exposed?\"",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Captain, do you still think",
  " the Gundam GP02A",
  " is targeting Jaburo?\"",
  "\"Surely not...",
  " But the General Staff...\"",
  "\"Using the Fleet Review as bait,",
  " they're rushing to settle",
  " this in one stroke...\"",
  "The Immortal 4th Platoon,",
  "in the One Year War,",
  "never lost a single man;",
  "as for why, there exist",
  "a great many theories.",
  "The fronts and times they saw,",
  "each member's skill and training,",
  "the high performance of the MS",
  "they happened to be issued.",
  "But this account would credit,",
  "above all, their leader,",
  "Burning.",
  "Burning was no extraordinary man,",
  "but an ordinary one.",
  "If Gato revered the full moon",
  "that comes but once a month,",
  "Burning was a man who, above all,",
  "cherished each morning's dawn.",
  "There is a truth",
  "most people never notice.",
  "A today the same as yesterday,",
  "a tomorrow the same as today.",
  "How much effort it takes",
  "to keep things that way!",
  "Was Burning not",
  "a man who knew",
  "exactly that?",
  "To be so caught up in feelings",
  "that one neglects",
  "the life one is living now.",
  "Was he not a man who loathed",
  "that more than anything?",
  "So above glory or kills, he prized",
  "doing the duty that was his",
  "and then, without fail,",
  "coming home alive, above all.",
  "Bringing his men home alive",
  "was his greatest source of pride.",
  "Gato's great cause is beautiful.",
  "But unless one lives, however ugly,",
  "nothing can begin.",
  "Protecting one's family,",
  "a lofty will to change the world:",
  "all depend on being alive.",
  "And does a great cause, built",
  "upon the corpses of others,",
  "have the right to destroy the lives",
  "of those living here and now?",
  "Burning was a man whose answer",
  "was 'No.'",
  "Inside the Albion",
  "Zeon Soldier",
  "\"Graaaagh!\"",
  "Monsha",
  "\"How's that!",
  " Feelin' a little",
  " better now, huh?!\"",
  "\"A prisoner?\"",
  "\"What's it look like?",
  " The Delaz Fleet, now--\"",
  "\"we figured he'd tell us",
  " all about it, nice and slow.\"",
  "\"Agh!",
  " Nnnnggh!\"",
  "\"Stop it!",
  " Lieutenant Monsha!\"",
  "\"Against the treaty, is it?!",
  " Ya know damn well this",
  " ain't somethin' ya keep clean!\"",
  "Impatience gripped them all.",
  "Remorse at losing Burning,",
  "unease over Gato's scheme,",
  "all tangled together, as at last",
  "the speech heralding the start",
  "of the Fleet Review began.",
  "Wyatt",
  "\"Universal Century 0079.",
  " That is, the last war was,",
  " for mankind, the worst of years.\"",
  "\"Having overcome this hardship,",
  " to now, after three years,",
  " hold a Fleet Review once more\"",
  "\"as the embodiment of peace",
  " and stability in the Earth Sphere",
  " brings me boundless joy...\"",
  "\"Not this sector either!",
  " Where's the real target?!\"",
  "\"Gato's only one unit,",
  " but he's got a nuclear warhead.\"",
  "Adel",
  "\"The Mk-82, huh.\"",
  "\"Any reports of something",
  " like that flare earlier?\"",
  "\"Hah! What enemy's gonna",
  " shout 'Ready, set, go!'",
  " before attackin'?!\"",
  "The Federation was incompetent,",
  "its leadership corrupt,",
  "making blunder after blunder.",
  "The rulers who lived on Earth",
  "looked up from the gravity well",
  "and believed that, from there,",
  "they could rule the space-born.",
  "That was evil, beyond question,",
  "and to rage at it was only right.",
  "But that does not mean",
  "that killing someone's parent,",
  "someone's husband or wife,",
  "someone's son or daughter,",
  "can ever be justified",
  "anywhere in this universe.",
  "That is a path of carnage that",
  "won't stop until all are slain.",
  "A path that leads to an endless",
  "chain of revenge...",
  "Someone",
  "has to break it.",
  "If one seeks a way for people",
  "to survive forever,",
  "so our children need never kill,",
  "so our grandchildren may laugh--",
  "if one truly thinks that way...",
  "That is why they fought Gato.",
  "The Federation",
  "may not have been in the right.",
  "But even if it was unjust,",
  "could they possibly ignore",
  "the deaths of the people",
  "before their very eyes?",
  "Those deaths--if they thought of",
  "the calamity they would bring,",
  "the tragedy they would bring,",
  "the future they would bring,",
  "how could they not fight?",
  "had a mentor who knew that weight;",
  "they were his disciples.",
  "Gone now was the man",
  "who above all cared for his men;",
  "Though he had perished in body,",
  "his will lived on in them.",
  "\"Uraki, behind you!\"",
  "\"These guys are pros!",
  " They're not like the last bunch!\"",
  "\"If, on top of this,",
  " Gato shows up here...!\"",
  "\"What?!",
  " Gato's at S0!\"",
  "\"Can we make it",
  " in time from here?!\"",
  "\"Go, Uraki!",
  " The Full Burnern can make it!\"",
  "\"!\"",
  "\"Yes, ma'am!\"",
  "\"Leave this to us!",
  " Keith, you go too!\"",
  "entrusted all to the two young men",
  "and sent them off.",
  "The last two disciples",
  "raised by the mentor they revered.",
  "Chuck Keith and",
  "Kou Uraki.",
  "To the two who had faced Gato",
  "from the very beginning",
  "of it all...",
  "Otto Karius Takes the Stage",
  "Otto Karius was",
  "an MS pilot under Gato,",
  "in the Space Attack Force's",
  "302nd Patrol Squadron.",
  "Gato's trusted right hand, he was",
  "given command of the squadron",
  "in hiding after the One Year War",
  "and is said to have lived",
  "with its men in Side 6.",
  "The word one most often hears",
  "used to describe Karius",
  "is \"steadfast.\"",
  "Certainly, his record of leading",
  "the squadron in hiding for Gato,",
  "and other scattered anecdotes,",
  "can be said to convey",
  "his steadfast nature.",
  "But to put it the other way,",
  "nothing else is said of him.",
  "If anything else is said,",
  "it is that he, too,",
  "like Gato's other hardy veterans,",
  "was a fine MS pilot,",
  "and little more.",
  "If Gato was the moon shining bright",
  "in the night sky, he was the night",
  "itself that set it off.",
  "Always at his side,",
  "serving as his shadow.",
  "Such was the man Karius.",
  "Aboard a Delaz Fleet Ship",
  "Karius",
  "\"Commander...\"",
  "Gato",
  "\"Hm?\"",
  "\"Are you",
  " feeling unwell?\"",
  "\"No, I was thinking of our comrades",
  " who fell in this sea.\"",
  "\"Indeed. Of those who fought",
  " at your side, Commander,",
  " I am the only one left.\"",
  "\"Karius,",
  " did I do the right thing?\"",
  "\"Returning here, where",
  " so many souls drift...\"",
  "\"Do I not stand atop",
  " a great many sacrifices?\"",
  "\"That is the fate",
  " of one who commands.",
  " This sea is still young.\"",
  "\"For its waves to grow calm",
  " will take time yet...\"",
  "\"Indeed...",
  " ...All I can do",
  " is race on to the end.\"",
  "Karius was, one might say,",
  "the one who stood for all the men",
  "who followed Gato.",
  "Believing in his convictions,",
  "believing in his wishes,",
  "believing in the future he'd build,",
  "they rode into battle at his side,",
  "and Karius stood for those men.",
  "In a sense, more than Gato himself,",
  "Karius spoke for the heroic dead.",
  "If Gato was a soul that wavered,",
  "agonized, yet fought for ideals,",
  "Karius had no doubts at all.",
  "All he had was",
  "the will to follow a proud back",
  "and to aid that man's convictions,",
  "that and nothing else.",
  "In a sense, it was close to",
  "that of a martyr resigned to die.",
  "That is why he could not see it.",
  "Who Gato truly was,",
  "what he wavered over,",
  "what troubled him--",
  "put the other way, he",
  "and the martyrs like him",
  "never understood any of it.",
  "Later, Gato would tell",
  "the Federation pilot Kou Uraki",
  "that the beginnings of war",
  "are, every one of them, rooted",
  "in grudges.",
  "Indeed, just as Gato himself",
  "said, the war of the space-born",
  "was born of grudges.",
  "Yet Gato also denied that grudges",
  "alone could sustain a war, saying",
  "a great cause goes beyond them.",
  "Yet in spite of that,",
  "Gato never once spoke of",
  "a great cause beyond grudges.",
  "All Gato said of his great cause",
  "was nothing but words of revenge.",
  "The words Gato later declared",
  "in battle with Kou Uraki in the GP01,",
  "resolutely, to his enemy--",
  "every one of them",
  "was Gato himself",
  "speaking to Gato.",
  "Yes, Gato himself was a man",
  "who fought, propped by grudges,",
  "who fought as a cog in",
  "the great cause Delaz preached.",
  "Of course, no solid record shows",
  "that Gato saw this contradiction,",
  "or that he wavered and agonized.",
  "But this account concludes he did.",
  "At A Baoa Qu, Gato was moved",
  "by Delaz's great cause and words,",
  "and, killing his own self, obeyed.",
  "But at the same time, that was",
  "surely the death of the man Gato.",
  "From then on, Gato",
  "had lived as a dead man.",
  "Under a cause's borrowed name,",
  "to fulfill his grudge and revenge.",
  "And that was something",
  "the man named Karius",
  "could never quite understand.",
  "Inside the Ship",
  "Captain",
  "\"Commander, it's time.",
  " Good luck in battle!\"",
  "\"Heh... the space",
  " I remember so well...\"",
  "\"Captain!",
  " Where's the launch flare?\"",
  "\"B-but!",
  " This operation's success",
  " depends on surprise!\"",
  "\"If the enemy can see through us",
  " over something this small,\"",
  "\"then heaven was never...",
  " going to side with me anyway!",
  " Fire!\"",
  "\"Roger!\"",
  "\"My thanks!",
  " ...Now, all that's left is to go!\"",
  "Gato was a dream all too vivid",
  "and beautiful.",
  "The finest wine, carrying all who",
  "drank it into sweet intoxication.",
  "Karius, all of Gato's followers,",
  "wanted to stay drunk",
  "on that wine and that dream.",
  "That is why they did not grasp",
  "Gato's contradiction.",
  "They refused to acknowledge it.",
  "Gato's great cause.",
  "Delaz's great cause.",
  "In either case, what it truly was,",
  "what exactly it",
  "aimed to achieve--",
  "no one knows.",
  "Most of them simply believed",
  "that making Earth's people feel",
  "the hardships of space's people",
  "would be good enough.",
  "They believed that would suffice.",
  "But in that same battle",
  "with Kou Uraki, Gato",
  "also said this:",
  "As an officer, see the big picture--",
  "so he said.",
  "Those words tell us",
  "one thing.",
  "No great cause may be a grudge.",
  "Merely achieving revenge",
  "does not end our fight.",
  "That was a feeling wrung from him",
  "as if he were spitting blood.",
  "Gato must have known.",
  "That even if they killed thousands,",
  "tens, even hundreds of thousands",
  "of Federation troops in battle,",
  "the lives of space's people",
  "would not get any easier;",
  "that however they might win",
  "on one field, the Earth Federation",
  "would not change its ways.",
  "But those who followed Gato",
  "did not grasp that.",
  "Followers, making themselves cogs",
  "of the so-called great cause,",
  "which they did not truly grasp,",
  "who idly, loudly shouted",
  "words of revenge and rancor, of",
  "national victory, with no vision.",
  "What, one wonders, did Gato",
  "think of them?",
  "Just one thing is certain:",
  "that Gato judged himself, too,",
  "to be nothing but such a follower,",
  "and that he felt,",
  "more than anything, a deep shame",
  "at his own immaturity,",
  "so far from those ideals.",
  "That alone.",
  "And so,",
  "however he contradicted himself,",
  "he chose the path of fighting.",
  "\"To leave the blessings of space,",
  " meant for all, to be trampled",
  " by a petty, contemptible few...\"",
  "\"Pathetic!",
  " To let the Federation spout",
  " such foul rhetoric!\"",
  "\"This...",
  " is an insult to those who fell.\"",
  "\"Commander,",
  " what does it matter?",
  " The fact is, we are here.\"",
  "\"Yes. To sweep away",
  " the Federation's walking dead...",
  " Karius! How is our course?\"",
  "\"The compass is fine.",
  " That speech is obligingly",
  " guiding us in.\"",
  "\"Good! I'll charge into the bay!",
  " All but my escort,",
  " begin the diversion as planned!\"",
  "There is nothing that can be won",
  "without a fight.",
  "Whatever the means of that fight,",
  "simply being alive here",
  "is an unending struggle.",
  "That is why Gato fights.",
  "However little understood,",
  "however he frets and wavers,",
  "however he contradicts himself,",
  "as a warrior, he simply goes!",
  "\"...Even now, this much",
  " of the battle for Solomon",
  " still remains here...\"",
  "\"Is this sea",
  " weeping, I wonder?",
  " Trying to tell us something...\"",
  "\"It is welcoming us.",
  " I can hear it.\"",
  "\"Karius!",
  " This is far enough!",
  " Begin evasive maneuvers!\"",
  "\"It's still dangerous.",
  " A little longer!\"",
  "\"Heh. How many times did I",
  " slip past the Federation's eyes",
  " and sortie from here!\"",
  "\"With this, 'Operation Stardust'...",
  " Hm!\"",
  "\"Enemy mobile suit!\"",
  "\"Tch!",
  " Delays will endanger our cause!\"",
  " Leave this to me!",
  " Go to Konpei Island!\"",
  "\"I mean, to Solomon!\"",
  "\"I'm counting on you!\"",
  "Now, a warrior sets out.",
  "To a place that was once his home.",
  "Holy ground where he risked death.",
  "And at the same time,",
  "a seat of evil ruled by the enemy.",
  "There, to raise a signal fire,",
  "the man would stake his life.",
  "Yes--to raise the signal fire",
  "to free the people of space...",
  "\"Lieutenant Uraki, Nina-kun,",
  " thank you for coming.\"",
  "\"The truth is, I don't think",
  " we've yet seen the real nature",
  " of 'Operation Stardust'...\"",
  "\"In other words,",
  " the raid on Konpei Island",
  " may be a prelude to something.\"",
  "\"Otherwise, why would Delaz",
  " have bothered to deliver",
  " such a grand speech?\"",
  "Nina",
  "\"It was just a threat...\"",
  "\"I can't believe that.\"",
  "\"So.",
  " I sought instructions from",
  " General Cowen at Jaburo,\"",
  "\"and we've decided to continue",
  " combat against the Delaz Fleet.\"",
  "\"Nina-san, the reason",
  " the Gundam GP01 and GP02A",
  " were taken to Australia...\"",
  "\"was that those two were",
  " the only ones that needed",
  " testing under gravity, yes?\"",
  "\"Stop it!",
  " That isn't under",
  " my authority!\"",
  "\"So there is one...",
  " a third unit...\"",
  "\"With the Lieutenant's record",
  " and Nina-san's technical",
  " support...\"",
  "\"Captain,",
  " please, let me do it!\"",
  "\"No!",
  " It's a completely different type!\"",
  "\"This ship has already",
  " changed course,\"",
  "\"toward 'La Vie en Rose',",
  " which is cruising Point 35B",
  " for testing.\"",
  "\"Ah...\"",
  " Emergency report, sir!\"",
  "\"Colony hijacking!?\"",
  "\"But what's this about",
  " blowing up the mirrors!\"",
  "\"The mirrors!\"",
  "\"If my guess is right,",
  " each colony, having lost",
  " one of its mirrors...\"",
  "\"will have its center of gravity",
  " shift, and its rotation warp.",
  " Eventually, these two...\"",
  "\"Hm...",
  " so they'll collide!\"",
  "\"Naturally! When they collide,",
  " each colony is flung away!",
  " The moon's gravity catches one.\"",
  "\"What!",
  " A colony drop on the moon!\"",
  " Change this ship's course too!\"",
  "\"From this position,",
  " we won't make it in time...\"",
  "\"Dammit!\"",
  "\"There's no telling yet",
  " how things will change!",
  " For now, the Gundam!\""
 ]
}
